    "summary": "**[Cloudstrider](vsdata:ability/aeldari.baharroth.cloudstrider)** has two options while Baharroth leads a unit. If outside [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) at the enemy turn’s close, the unit can enter [Strategic Reserves](vsdata:core-rule/strategic-reserves). During your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) the unit can arrive using [Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike), setting up over 6″ horizontally from every enemy. It cannot charge during its arrival turn.",
